750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) sprayer surface (grimy buildup);
B) general surfaces of kettle cooker (food splash/dust - under kettle & lower brackets);
C) bottom storage area under salad bar (food debris);
D) large ice machine (dust buildup - legs, underneath surfaces, & backside/condensate line);  and
E) stove top - drip trays (splash) & around knobs (grease/dust).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.

